>>
Rule 2 (x must be a valid type)
{x : tensor} |= (dtype_(x) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 5) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 0) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 10) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 11)
>>
Rule 3 (y must be a valid type)
{y : tensor} |= (dtype_(y) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 5) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 0) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 10) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 11)
>>
Rule 4 (at least one dimension of x is greater than zero)
{x : tensor} |= ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (at least one dimension of y is greater than zero)
{y : tensor} |= ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (x and y must have same number of dimensions)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) = ndim(y)
>>
Rule 9 (If x has more dimensions than y, shapes of x in higher dimensions must be 1)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(x) > ndim(y) then ∀i ∈ [ndim(y), ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = 1
>>
Rule 10 (If y has more dimensions than x, shapes of y in higher dimensions must be 1)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(y) > ndim(x) then ∀i ∈ [ndim(x), ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) = 1
>>
Rule 17 (If x has dimensions 1, then all elements along those dimension must equal zero)
{x : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : if shape(x, i) = 1 then true
>>
Rule 18 (If y has dimensions 1, then all elements along those dimensions must equal zero)
{y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : if shape(y, i) = 1 then true
>>
Rule 20 (Higher dimensions of the larger tensor should be 1)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(x) > ndim(y) then ∀i ∈ [ndim(y), ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = 1 else if ndim(y) > ndim(x) then ∀i ∈ [ndim(x), ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) = 1
>>
Rule 23 (Broadcasting is valid)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(x) < ndim(y) then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1) ∧ (∀i ∈ [ndim(x), ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) = 1)  else if ndim(x) > ndim(y) then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1) ∧ (∀i ∈ [ndim(y), ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = 1) else (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 24 (x must be one of the valid dtypes for FloorDiv)
{x : tensor} |= (dtype_(x) = 0) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 5) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(x) = 10)
>>
Rule 25 (y must be one of the valid dtypes for FloorDiv)
{y : tensor} |= (dtype_(y) = 0) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 5) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 8) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 9) ∨ (dtype_(y) = 10)
>>
Rule 27 (FloorDiv only supports numerical dtypes.)
{x : tensor} |= (dtype_(x) ≠ 11) ∧ (dtype_(x) ≠ 12)
>>
Rule 29 (Broadcasting: Dimensions must be compatible or one of the dimensions has size one)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) = ndim(y) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1) ∨ (ndim(x) ≠ ndim(y))
>>
Rule 33 (Either x or y must be a tensor with more than one element.)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) > 0 ∧ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 1) ∨ (ndim(y) > 0 ∧ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) > 1)
>>
Rule 36 (If x has fewer dimensions than y after prepending dimensions of size 1, shapes of y must be 1 in those dimensions)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(x) < ndim(y) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - ndim(x) - 1] : shape(y, i) = 1
>>
Rule 37 (If y has fewer dimensions than x after prepending dimensions of size 1, shapes of x must be 1 in those dimensions)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(y) < ndim(x) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - ndim(y) - 1] : shape(x, i) = 1
